{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/09/25/5684114/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名古屋の全国握手会、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体調不良で握手会を欠席しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ご迷惑、ご心配おかけしました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしていたみなさんに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"申し訳ないです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しばらくは心が休まらないのと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ち着かない日が続くけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"集中しなきゃできないことしかないので"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"途切れないよう、体調面も気を付けます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の個別握手会、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうぞよろしくお願い致します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/09/25/5684114/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しばらく建物にこもりっぱなしだから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"森林浴したい！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/09/25/5684114/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アンダーライブ全国ツアー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中国シリーズ終わりました〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島、岡山、山口のみなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新しい演出と立ち位置と考え方、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までの自分とまったく違う"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真っ新な気持ちで臨みました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステージに立っている時、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"曲を身体でどう表現するか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その時の感覚でつくっていくあの感じ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひたすら楽しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって全身で表現してるんだから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全身見てほしいもんね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大きな箱だとそうもいかないんだけど。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どちらも違った魅力がある！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり最後のブロックが印象的。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"命は美しい、自由の彼方、きっかけ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特にこの3曲。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろんなことが頭の中を駆け巡って、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3日目で気持ちの整理がつきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台が終わった頃には"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また気持ちに変化が出るかもしれない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっとどこかで葛藤してます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずっと闘ってる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2016/09/25/5684114/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"スタッフの皆さん、メンバーのみんな"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にお疲れ様でした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなちま、お疲れ様でした！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"照明と幕と後ろの舞台セットが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"曲ごとにさらさら変わっていくんですけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃくちゃかっこよくて感動してました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生命力を感じる血管が伝ったような木"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とても好きだった！！素敵でした〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type"